msgid "plugins.generic.rankingPlugin.settings.displayPositionSection"
msgstr "After which section?"

msgid "plugins.generic.rankingPlugin.settings.displayPositionSection.description"
msgstr "Use this to place the ranking block in the middle of the homepage. The count covers every section your theme stacks on the page — the homepage image, the journal description, the announcements, the current issue, the additional content, and anything else the theme renders. Enter 1 to place the block after the first section, 2 for after the second, and so on. What counts as a section depends on the theme and on what the journal has configured, and some themes group several of them into one, so expect to try a couple of numbers. A number higher than the number of sections puts the block at the bottom."

